Silver: Just stop.

Sonic: ?

Silver: This is the very reason none of them want to talk to you. 

Silver: I mean who even was that? 

Sonic: Was what?

Silver: The woman behind me. You even decorated me like her. You're still doing the very thing they stopped talking to you for.

Silver: And even worse, you're doing it to me. I didn't give you any consent to change me like that...

Sonic: ...Silver...what are you talking about?

Silver: [color=red]I'm not talking to you Sonic.[/color]
